      "claim": "EVT 301, which contains the same 3-fluorobenzyloxy aryl ether motif as the query, showed >90% brain MAO-B occupancy in human PET imaging, directly demonstrating meaningful BBB penetration.",
      "evidence_role": "supportive"
    },
    {
      "card_ids": ["C01"],
